WEBVTT

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:19.850
Your bloodstained peace is the real crime.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:25.810
Kurisu.

00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:28.020
Theresa.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.690
Don't do this.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:33.240
You must know you're being used.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.740
We both are.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:39.790
Torri thinks he's brainwashed me.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:42.580
Auma is dead.

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:47.290
I warned him, but you know how he was.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.960
You're going about this all wrong.

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:52.800
I'm a father.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:56.550
I have to move time forward,
for my son's sake.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:59.010
I've gone too far to turn back.

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:01.770
Take care of Harris... my son.

00:01:01.930 --> 00:01:03.060
Wait, Kurisu!

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.700
Let me crack the case right now.

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:19.240
Meaning?

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:22.830
The culprit is Kurisu O'Brien.

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:26.580
Draw the knives
locked behind your eyelids.

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:30.380
Reap the lives that grow into shackles.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:34.090
Even the lost memories that flee
once they're liberated and banished

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:36.930
Are an everlasting cubism.

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:57.820
Cause I know that in a future gone mad,

00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:01.580
Even nightmares are peaceful.

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:03.660
RESET, RESET, yeah.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:07.620
The midnight sun
awakens and turns to a riot.

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:12.170
A gun for a faux-friendly kiss.
A knife for a faux-revolutionary hug.

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:18.510
Get rid of it all, even the frozen chains.

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:22.430
Reality is always outside your head.

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:27.140
In a world seen through bestial eyes,

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:33.070
There is neither darkness nor light.

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:40.820
Draw the knives
locked behind your eyelids.

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:44.490
Reap the lives that grow into shackles.

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:48.160
Even the false memories that flash before
your eyes impatiently and impulsively

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.670
Are an everlasting cubism.

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:01.090
"Inspector"...

00:03:01.760 --> 00:03:04.470
I have to tell Arata.

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:12.440
Maiko!

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:17.440
Damn you!

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:22.320
Now, who are the Ministry of
Foreign Affairs' undercover investigators?

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:24.370
I don't know!

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:26.490
Don't lie to me.

00:03:29.450 --> 00:03:32.120
Don't you want to keep
your lovely wife from danger?

00:03:34.130 --> 00:03:35.130
Stop!

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:38.920
Let me rephrase the question.

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:43.180
I have information about your brother.

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:44.010
What?

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:48.520
If you talk, I'll tell you.

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:51.020
I really don't know anything!

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:53.900
Excuse me, Third.

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:57.070
What is it?

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.940
Let's have a quick chat outside.

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:04.530
I swear I'll save you, Maiko!

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:09.790
It's only a threat.

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:12.160
Is that the issue here?

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:14.920
Don't take Public Safety for fools.

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:17.670
They'll raid the place any minute now.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:22.340
So what's the big idea
with taking more hostages?

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:25.720
I will have them become Eternal White.

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:30.020
If I claim that they converted
and joined Heaven's Leap...

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:32.850
You really think that'll fly?

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:37.860
We have Bifrost on our side.

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:42.610
Very well. I'll leave this to you.

00:04:43.610 --> 00:04:45.860
Are you dissatisfied with my efforts?

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:50.450
I'll see my job through to the end.
Don't worry about that.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:06.720
You're...

00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:08.850
Look at this.

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:11.350
Harris Sho Flannagan

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:15.230
Kurisu's son joined Heaven's Leap?

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:17.810
Let me start from the top.

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:20.690
First, Torri joined Heaven's Leap.

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:26.240
Then, when the special religious zone
was proposed, Nisei vanished

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:29.820
and Kurisu's son ended up
in a vegetative state.

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:32.740
Then, Kurisu fell ill.

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:36.460
You're saying Torri is behind everything?

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:40.960
Yes. Torri manipulated Kurisu
into orchestrating these attacks.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:45.510
But he couldn't count on
Kurisu getting sick, could he?

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:49.590
On the contrary, I don't believe
the illness was a coincidence.

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:53.060
Shion,
didn't the list of members include...

00:05:53.180 --> 00:05:54.140
Yes.

00:05:55.430 --> 00:06:00.730
Cancer treatment and artificial cancer
research specialist Dr. Saburo Nihei.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:04.110
Meaning Kurisu's illness
was artificially induced,

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:06.490
in order to control him.

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:11.450
Wow, Inspector.
You're firing on all cylinders today.

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:14.240
So, how do we prove it?

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:17.370
We don't have a warrant for a search.

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.250
We'll take Kurisu and Shinogi in custody.

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:23.630
Then let's consider negotiating
with Heaven's Leap.

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:25.880
Negotiate with the mastermind?

00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:28.930
I'd do anything

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:33.760
to prevent further attacks
and rescue our infiltration team.

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:38.390
I'm in, Inspector.

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:40.400
So, how do we catch them?

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:44.520
We use the location data from the drones
used to implant bombs.

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:49.400
They automatically access a data bank
when they perform remote surgeries.

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:52.910
Got it. I'll check them ASAP.

00:06:57.370 --> 00:06:58.160
Maiko.

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.370
I'm sure you're worried, but...

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:01.170
I know.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:05.000
They won't kill us
while they still have questions.

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:08.170
It's Kei I'm worried about.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:14.260
Kei could easily kill everyone here,

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:17.180
but he's restraining himself.

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:20.310
We left our home to escape that violence.

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:24.360
I suppose you might call it "karma" here.

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:29.440
We saw so many deaths in our motherland.

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:33.110
But we still tried to find peace together.

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:39.790
In the end,
I lost my eyesight in an explosion,

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:45.630
and even in this peaceful country,
Kei still works as a soldier.

00:08:34.970 --> 00:08:36.930
Crime Coefficient is 40.

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:41.600
Not a target for enforcement action.
The trigger will be locked.

00:08:43.560 --> 00:08:44.940
I thought I'd find you here,

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:47.270
Sister Shinogi.

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:56.450
Inspector, I've found logs
of a transplant on Kurisu.

00:08:57.450 --> 00:09:00.290
What made you think I would be here?

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:03.460
It's because you're trying to help Kurisu.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.960
I suppose you would've preferred him?

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:11.630
This all began with a plan

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:14.800
devised by you, Kurisu, Auma, and Nisei.

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:18.760
A plan to expose crimes
against immigrants.

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:21.180
Yes, that's right.

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:25.190
Wasn't Auma smuggling arms?
He was a criminal himself!

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:30.570
Those weapons are made to break
after being used for a certain period.

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:34.650
Auma was doing it deliberately
in order to control

00:09:34.820 --> 00:09:37.490
the trafficking of weapons
in war-torn countries.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.490
You provided him with funding.

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:41.530
We were treating symptoms.

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:45.330
It took time and money,
but it was effective.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:49.000
Then, you thought of
a more effective method.

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:52.000
You would use terrorist bombings

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:57.510
to eliminate criminals and expose crimes
without having to expel immigrants.

00:09:58.550 --> 00:10:02.350
We called it the Final Salvation Plan.

00:10:02.560 --> 00:10:04.770
It should never have been
put into action.

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:10.520
Yes, your father once said the same thing.

00:10:15.240 --> 00:10:17.610
But our plan was used.

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:21.240
Used by a power
that exceeded our imagination.

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:24.740
What power?

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:28.790
Bifrost.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:31.880
Believers in the Ministry of Welfare

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:35.630
tell me that we will be raided soon.

00:10:36.090 --> 00:10:39.090
Heaven's Leap has served its purpose.

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:43.430
Have the gears accomplish
their final objective.

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:44.930
Yes, Mom.

00:10:45.430 --> 00:10:49.980
There will be an open seat
in Bifrost soon. A seat for you.

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:52.730
The rest will work itself out.

00:10:53.570 --> 00:10:54.270
Yes.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:59.900
You'll succeed to my brother's seat,
which Homura stole.

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:03.410
We will win this game.

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:09.120
Your brother, you say?

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:11.790
He really is just like his father.

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:14.590
Time's up.

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:17.130
Then let me handle the rest.

00:11:17.630 --> 00:11:19.090
Suit yourself.

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:24.890
What is it?

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:27.970
My shift's not over yet.

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:43.910
Maiko, Kisaragi.

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:44.990
Kei!

00:11:45.120 --> 00:11:46.160
Inspector!

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:49.910
Dangerous bottoms have escaped.

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:54.250
The bottoms have stolen doctors' uniforms

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:57.460
and are holding
a visually impaired woman hostage.

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:01.800
If you spot them,
report them to the nearest doctor at once.

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:09.180
What's the situation, Kei?

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:10.850
There's a wall ahead.

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:16.190
I think Enforcer Kisaragi can escape
if she uses me as a stepping stool.

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:18.190
Inspector?

00:12:18.650 --> 00:12:20.030
Hurry.

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:22.950
If you don't escape, we'll all be killed.

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:26.070
Please wait. I...

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:36.960
I'll bring help.

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:39.130
Please do.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:14.540
I know Arata will come to save us.

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:16.250
Yeah.

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:29.600
Torri!

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:32.560
How ill-behaved you bottoms are.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:41.020
Kei!

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:44.030
Take them away.

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:48.870
What is Bifrost?

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:55.660
A powerful organization that controls
the group called the "foxes."

00:13:55.870 --> 00:14:00.210
It's likely that Torri is involved
with Bifrost as well.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:02.210
So they're the mastermind?

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:06.880
Probably, but that's all I know.

00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:09.720
Please tell me one thing.

00:14:10.220 --> 00:14:13.640
Why did you have us
take custody of Kurisu's son?

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:18.730
Because that boy is a weakness
to Theresa and me.

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:20.900
Kurisu.

00:14:22.230 --> 00:14:26.490
My wife passed away
soon after our son was born.

00:14:26.940 --> 00:14:31.780
After that, Theresa cared for him
as if he were her own son.

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.950
She loved him.

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:39.500
He was such a kind boy. He was our hope.

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:44.960
He said that he wanted
to improve the plight of immigrants

00:14:45.340 --> 00:14:47.510
and went to join Nisei.

00:14:48.260 --> 00:14:51.220
But that derailed everything.

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:54.310
It was Torri.

00:14:54.470 --> 00:14:57.730
This would never have happened
if Nisei were healthy.

00:14:58.060 --> 00:15:03.520
You swore not salvation, but revenge on
the society that created discrimination.

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:07.280
You really are a chip off the old block.

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:11.450
You can read so deeply into the mind
of someone you've never met.

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:16.990
You brainwashed the bombers
as revenge for your son.

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:18.790
You're right.

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:24.630
I blew the people who abused him
in the name of religion to smithereens.

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:28.970
It's highly probable that your cancer
was artificially induced.

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:31.050
I know.

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:36.970
I never wished for it,
but it's shown me what I should live for.

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:38.810
Stop, Kurisu.

00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:40.730
That's enough, Theresa.

00:15:42.690 --> 00:15:46.230
Give Public Safety
what I left in your care.

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:49.490
It will be my final insurance.

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:24.100
I'll stop the bleeding.

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:25.350
You OK, Temma?

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:27.520
I'm fine. How's the Sister?

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:31.440
Arata Shindo...

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:33.860
You...

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:36.370
No! Don't die on me!

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:42.120
You mustn't become like us...

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:45.500
or like your father...

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:05.310
Even if a century were to go by
in this very instant,

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:08.060
it would be no surprise.

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:10.270
It's raining.

00:17:10.610 --> 00:17:12.280
It's raining.

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:16.490
This is the truth.

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:21.580
Arata Shindo, do your job!

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:26.250
I'll find the sniper.

00:17:27.170 --> 00:17:29.880
You can't! We don't know
their numbers or positions.

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:31.750
Check with drones first...

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:35.090
Or you'll be shot like Todoroki!

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:37.430
This is what enforcers are for!

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:40.430
Enforcers are people, not shields!

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:45.430
Target eliminated.

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:46.690
I'm pulling out.

00:17:55.610 --> 00:17:58.860
I'll see you on the other side, Theresa.

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:13.670
I see the pieces are all in place.

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:19.800
I hope you'll actually
lure the target out this time.

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:22.810
Certainly.

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:27.980
Psycho-Pass exceeding permissible values
in Shinmisono, Itabashi.

00:18:28.520 --> 00:18:31.730
Inspectors on duty, proceed to the scene
with Enforcers.

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:36.280
Mao!

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:42.660
Kisaragi!

00:18:43.370 --> 00:18:44.290
Kisaragi!

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:47.330
I'm glad you're safe.

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:50.040
I'm here, too.

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:53.500
What, is that all I get?

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:55.500
I'm sorry.

00:18:56.510 --> 00:18:58.010
Don't apologize.

00:18:58.550 --> 00:19:00.680
Your cover was blown, huh?

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:05.510
Kei's been captured. At this rate...

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:07.020
So has Maiko.

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:09.890
What did you say?

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:12.400
Inspector Ignatov and his wife

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:16.480
are both being held
in the Heaven's Leap facility.

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:21.410
Here.

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:27.410
Inspector Ignatov gave me this.

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:38.380
I'll analyze it ASAP.

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:45.720
Inspector Shindo,

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:48.220
please, search Heaven's Leap.

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:52.900
The chief's talking to the bureau chief.

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:58.230
Let's do what we can for now.

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:04.450
With all four pocket watches,

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:08.740
I found the server
used to synchronize their plan.

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:17.590
So, this is the "Final Salvation Plan"
the Sister talked about?

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:22.840
It's the plan that Kurisu modified
for these attacks, to be precise.

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:23.800
Look.

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:27.100
There's one unfinished objective.

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:29.930
Governor Komiya.

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:31.770
I see.

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:34.770
The first bomb was meant to kill her.

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:37.440
That's why they needed a sixth.

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:41.490
An Immigration Bureau observer
murdering the governor.

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:45.280
It will be symbolic
of the immigration issue.

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:49.200
Kurisu plans to take all the blame.

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:55.080
This case is so critical, it can't
be closed until the culprit is dead.

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:11.470
I can't get through to the governor!

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:14.690
Why would Heaven's Leap
want the governor dead, anyway?

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:19.400
The special immigrant zone's
been on the table since her predecessor,

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:21.610
so it would go through anyway.

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:26.160
The governor's death
would create a power vacuum.

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:28.820
And they'll reap all the benefits?

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:33.080
But they'll be raided sooner or later.

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:35.080
They can't last any longer.

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:38.380
Any power they get
won't make a difference.

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:44.380
Maybe Torri assumed
we wouldn't press them this hard?

00:21:45.090 --> 00:21:48.260
Even so, he could have stopped the plan
at any time.

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:54.180
Kurisu's ultimate goal is to expose
the society that produces discrimination.

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:56.480
Then what is Torri's?

00:21:57.310 --> 00:22:01.690
What if he never cared
about the special zone?

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:02.900
What?

00:22:03.280 --> 00:22:07.360
If the governor dies, he'll gain
something better than the special zone.

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:10.410
But I don't know what that something is!

00:22:11.280 --> 00:22:13.910
We can't do anything about that, can we?

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:19.210
Putting the big picture together
when we have missing pieces

00:22:19.380 --> 00:22:20.920
is impossible, isn't it?

00:22:23.420 --> 00:22:24.800
I see.

00:22:27.090 --> 00:22:28.220
That piece...

00:22:29.260 --> 00:22:30.340
is Bifrost.

00:22:42.400 --> 00:22:45.070
Risk analysis is complete.

00:22:46.070 --> 00:22:47.030
Do it.

00:22:47.440 --> 00:22:48.150
Yes, ma'am.

00:22:49.110 --> 00:22:51.570
I have something I want to confirm, too.

00:22:52.740 --> 00:22:53.740
Which is?

00:22:54.450 --> 00:22:57.330
A string of killings
without malice aforethought.

00:22:58.290 --> 00:23:01.670
Methods designed
to outwit the Sibyl System

00:23:02.130 --> 00:23:05.840
have grown exceedingly objectionable.

00:23:56.310 --> 00:23:59.600
You're with the MOFA
Suppressing Action Department!

00:24:00.480 --> 00:24:02.850
I can't believe I'm saving you twice.

00:24:03.100 --> 00:24:04.440
Don't give us trouble.

00:24:07.900 --> 00:24:08.610
Our status?

00:24:10.860 --> 00:24:14.780
We have Nisei. I hid him in a safe place.

00:24:15.030 --> 00:24:16.700
Hey, what's going on?

00:24:18.160 --> 00:24:19.950
We're investigating, like you.

00:24:22.160 --> 00:24:24.420
They're holding my wife captive.

00:24:25.380 --> 00:24:26.750
Do you know where?

00:24:33.510 --> 00:24:36.970
There's a hidden passage
in Torri's office.

00:24:37.640 --> 00:24:38.600
Try there.

00:24:39.060 --> 00:24:40.310
I can't thank you enough.

00:24:41.560 --> 00:24:42.230
Hey.

00:24:47.310 --> 00:24:50.320
Should we really be leaving Torri to him?

00:24:51.280 --> 00:24:52.530
He'll be fine.

00:24:59.030 --> 00:24:59.990
Oh, it's you!

00:25:00.330 --> 00:25:01.330
Governor!

00:25:01.500 --> 00:25:03.000
I finally got through!

00:25:03.460 --> 00:25:06.000
You sound awfully intense, Mr. Detective.

00:25:06.540 --> 00:25:09.750
You're the next target
of the terrorist bombings.

00:25:11.710 --> 00:25:14.050
If you know that, then arrest the culprit.

00:25:14.630 --> 00:25:17.970
Are you at the special religious zone
press event venue?

00:25:18.430 --> 00:25:20.260
We're on our way there.

00:25:21.060 --> 00:25:22.470
Location data confirmed.

00:25:22.850 --> 00:25:24.060
Please turn back.

00:25:24.730 --> 00:25:25.810
We can't.

00:25:26.060 --> 00:25:30.270
Immigrants are already receiving
harsher treatment due to these incidents.

00:25:30.690 --> 00:25:32.400
We can't afford to cancel.

00:25:34.070 --> 00:25:35.990
Is it worth more than your life?

00:25:36.610 --> 00:25:40.280
I'm the governor.
This is something only I can do.

00:25:41.240 --> 00:25:42.540
You're so stubborn!

00:25:44.410 --> 00:25:46.290
Listen. In that case...

00:25:47.830 --> 00:25:49.630
Hang on, I'm getting a call.

00:25:49.750 --> 00:25:51.630
Who do you think you-

00:25:52.090 --> 00:25:53.800
Inspector, it's finally time.

00:25:53.920 --> 00:25:55.220
For the raid?

00:25:55.760 --> 00:25:59.760
Yes. I'll head to Heaven's Leap
headquarters with Unit Two.

00:26:00.970 --> 00:26:03.560
You stop the terrorist bombings.

00:26:03.770 --> 00:26:08.230
Yes, ma'am. The enemy is likely
heavily armed, so be careful.

00:26:08.520 --> 00:26:10.980
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:26:12.440 --> 00:26:13.230
Governor!

00:26:14.820 --> 00:26:16.570
Sorry I'm so stubborn.

00:26:16.740 --> 00:26:19.070
What are you talking about?

00:26:19.200 --> 00:26:20.370
Why, you...

00:26:20.490 --> 00:26:23.330
Well, in that case,
we'll go with plan B.

00:26:23.450 --> 00:26:24.410
What?

00:26:34.800 --> 00:26:37.970
They're forming a wall
of adherents with clear Hues.

00:26:38.550 --> 00:26:40.510
A blatant play for time.

00:26:41.350 --> 00:26:45.470
I judge it to be a malicious obstruction
and authorize tear-gas use.

00:27:07.410 --> 00:27:09.790
Help me, First.

00:27:10.500 --> 00:27:13.000
I can't contact Mom for some reason.

00:27:14.210 --> 00:27:15.800
Well, you see...

00:27:16.590 --> 00:27:19.970
Ms. Saionji has to protect herself, too.

00:27:21.180 --> 00:27:24.470
She left me to cover
for your carelessness.

00:27:25.220 --> 00:27:27.980
That's why I have your card.

00:27:28.180 --> 00:27:29.560
I wasn't told of this!

00:27:30.560 --> 00:27:32.400
Try to pull through.

00:27:32.900 --> 00:27:37.650
If you, as religious as you are,
have total faith in yourself and Sibyl,

00:27:38.490 --> 00:27:41.150
your Psycho-Pass will remain clear.

00:27:46.950 --> 00:27:48.160
Damn him...

00:27:55.040 --> 00:27:58.630
This is Third Inspector Torri Aschenbach.

00:27:59.670 --> 00:28:02.010
Have you made up your mind at last?

00:28:02.380 --> 00:28:05.680
Yes. I will become a congressman.

00:28:06.260 --> 00:28:09.930
But I won't take the seat
that Mom chose for me.

00:28:14.610 --> 00:28:16.110
Client data secured.

00:28:16.520 --> 00:28:19.360
There are a lot of names we don't have.

00:28:19.780 --> 00:28:22.860
Good.
Public Safety's started their search.

00:28:23.240 --> 00:28:24.530
It's time we left.

00:28:31.200 --> 00:28:33.500
Her again?

00:29:13.290 --> 00:29:14.290
Sniper located!

00:29:14.920 --> 00:29:16.080
Leave this to m...!

00:29:23.130 --> 00:29:23.840
Crap.

00:29:34.520 --> 00:29:37.770
How were you able to get here so soon?

00:29:38.860 --> 00:29:41.280
Our colleague who escaped Heaven's Leap HQ

00:29:41.820 --> 00:29:44.990
found Nisei's pocket watch for us.

00:29:47.240 --> 00:29:49.870
So, this too is God's will.

00:29:50.990 --> 00:29:55.620
I don't mind dying with a detective
instead of the governor.

00:29:58.330 --> 00:30:01.300
Target's threat assessment updated.

00:30:01.550 --> 00:30:04.920
Explosives. Destroy Decomposer.

00:30:05.090 --> 00:30:06.800
Don't move, Kurisu!

00:30:08.550 --> 00:30:10.600
Crime Coefficient is 45.

00:30:10.800 --> 00:30:12.510
Registered CID inspector.

00:30:12.760 --> 00:30:13.680
Warning.

00:30:13.850 --> 00:30:18.690
Rebellion by enforcers will be recorded
and reported to headquarters.

00:30:19.350 --> 00:30:20.230
Don't shoot!

00:30:21.520 --> 00:30:23.400
He's dangerous. Please move!

00:30:25.690 --> 00:30:28.530
Target's threat assessment updated.

00:30:28.860 --> 00:30:31.280
Crime Coefficient is 27.

00:30:31.780 --> 00:30:33.740
Not a target for enforcement action.

00:30:35.370 --> 00:30:39.500
You've committed crimes,
but only because you were being used.

00:30:43.300 --> 00:30:47.470
I was able to steel my resolve
because they made me sick.

00:30:47.760 --> 00:30:51.470
I'm grateful to Torri for that.

00:30:52.680 --> 00:30:54.850
You don't have to die here.

00:30:55.180 --> 00:30:57.390
No, this is what I must do.

00:30:57.980 --> 00:31:00.270
As the culprit in this case.

00:31:01.610 --> 00:31:05.190
My anguish led me to my crime.

00:31:05.400 --> 00:31:08.030
As a member of the Immigration Bureau...

00:31:19.410 --> 00:31:20.540
At last,

00:31:21.580 --> 00:31:23.880
I can move time forward.

00:31:24.630 --> 00:31:30.300
If I don't, this country's problems
will never be solved.

00:31:30.930 --> 00:31:34.140
No, it will never even realize

00:31:35.100 --> 00:31:36.930
that its problems exist.

00:31:38.060 --> 00:31:41.980
Moving time forward like this
won't make anyone happy.

00:31:43.270 --> 00:31:46.270
Target's threat assessment updated.

00:31:46.610 --> 00:31:48.070
Crime Coefficient is 7.

00:31:59.750 --> 00:32:02.790
If my son ever wakes up,

00:32:04.460 --> 00:32:07.250
I want him to see a beautiful world...

00:32:19.890 --> 00:32:21.600
This isn't for your son.

00:32:22.560 --> 00:32:25.270
You gave in to evil in order

00:32:25.730 --> 00:32:27.360
to fulfill your own desires.

00:32:31.400 --> 00:32:34.570
God will forgive everything.

00:32:42.830 --> 00:32:45.880
Your Psycho-Pass is special.

00:32:46.710 --> 00:32:48.630
Crime Coefficient is 0.

00:32:49.340 --> 00:32:51.420
The trigger will be locked.

00:32:57.720 --> 00:32:58.810
You...

00:33:00.810 --> 00:33:03.020
haven't forgiven anyone, have you?

00:33:17.320 --> 00:33:18.280
Inspector!

00:33:40.850 --> 00:33:43.480
Prioritize locating Inspector Ignatov.

00:33:43.680 --> 00:33:44.600
Yes, ma'am.

00:33:55.200 --> 00:33:55.990
Maiko!

00:34:25.640 --> 00:34:28.350
We're done here, Vixen. Get out.

00:34:28.560 --> 00:34:29.440
But...

00:34:29.980 --> 00:34:34.650
You want another shot at the old Unit One,
right? I'll give you a chance soon.

00:34:36.070 --> 00:34:37.030
Understood.

00:34:38.570 --> 00:34:39.410
Wait!

00:34:41.740 --> 00:34:42.410
Damn!

00:34:49.330 --> 00:34:50.710
Heaven's Leap is through.

00:34:51.040 --> 00:34:51.710
That's fine.

00:34:52.420 --> 00:34:56.300
I'm going to be a congressman, anyway.

00:35:04.510 --> 00:35:05.680
Stop right there!

00:35:06.930 --> 00:35:07.850
Kei!

00:35:09.100 --> 00:35:09.850
Maiko!

00:35:11.520 --> 00:35:13.440
You don't know when to quit!

00:35:13.900 --> 00:35:15.860
Just leave me alone!

00:35:16.320 --> 00:35:19.570
You keep trailing after me like a shadow.

00:35:19.900 --> 00:35:21.450
Give up!

00:35:22.120 --> 00:35:24.240
Give up? Me?

00:35:24.740 --> 00:35:27.580
I'm nothing like any of you.

00:35:27.750 --> 00:35:31.080
The god we call Sibyl has chosen me!

00:35:31.540 --> 00:35:34.340
Stop! If you're going
to shoot anyone, shoot me!

00:35:37.630 --> 00:35:40.630
Is that your pure and true conjugal love?

00:35:41.300 --> 00:35:43.430
Why not show your true colors?

00:35:44.550 --> 00:35:47.100
If you can't say it, I will.

00:35:47.930 --> 00:35:49.480
Both of you

00:35:49.810 --> 00:35:53.480
just want to hide your own weaknesses
from each other!

00:35:54.520 --> 00:35:58.820
"Love" is just a word you use to justify

00:35:58.990 --> 00:36:00.610
your own lies!

00:36:01.660 --> 00:36:04.620
The weak must die!

00:36:20.800 --> 00:36:22.300
Dear...

00:36:29.470 --> 00:36:30.520
I'm sorry.

00:36:33.140 --> 00:36:34.900
I'm glad you're all right.

00:36:37.400 --> 00:36:38.440
Can you see?

00:36:40.110 --> 00:36:43.280
I can see your face.

00:36:46.200 --> 00:36:48.490
You're crying.

00:37:26.490 --> 00:37:27.370
Kei...

00:37:35.460 --> 00:37:37.750
Why did Maiko get dragged into this?

00:37:40.840 --> 00:37:42.260
Say something!

00:37:44.260 --> 00:37:46.340
I won't make excuses.

00:37:49.890 --> 00:37:50.720
You...!

00:37:53.270 --> 00:37:54.730
Damn it!

00:37:56.690 --> 00:37:57.810
That's enough.

00:37:58.230 --> 00:38:01.020
Get some counseling
and psychological care.

00:38:07.910 --> 00:38:08.570
Yes, ma'am.

00:38:19.830 --> 00:38:23.130
We lost another inspector,

00:38:23.250 --> 00:38:26.550
but the Relation turned out well enough.

00:38:28.720 --> 00:38:31.640
Results confirmed. Apportioning dividends.

00:38:32.350 --> 00:38:35.680
That was close for you, Shirogane,

00:38:36.020 --> 00:38:38.520
but this is the end for Homura.

00:38:40.150 --> 00:38:41.820
But first...

00:38:43.820 --> 00:38:46.190
I have information

00:38:46.320 --> 00:38:50.570
supplied by Third Inspector Torri,
who passed away during the Relation.

00:38:51.570 --> 00:38:52.200
Indictment

00:38:53.620 --> 00:38:57.080
As you know, he was Kyoko's son.

00:38:57.960 --> 00:39:01.170
They behaved in a manner
unbefitting of our game.

00:39:01.880 --> 00:39:05.710
You tricked him, didn't you, Shirogane?

00:39:06.420 --> 00:39:07.420
Mom,

00:39:08.630 --> 00:39:10.840
you must be shocked right about now.

00:39:11.180 --> 00:39:12.600
This can't be!

00:39:12.760 --> 00:39:16.270
Mr. Shirogane revealed the truth to me.

00:39:16.600 --> 00:39:21.270
I can hardly believe that my father
was your own brother.

00:39:21.940 --> 00:39:25.610
It's your fault my Hue clouded, isn't it?

00:39:25.940 --> 00:39:30.860
I'm not the one who needs purification.

00:39:31.240 --> 00:39:32.240
It's you.

00:39:33.070 --> 00:39:36.290
As of today, the Saionji seat is mine.

00:39:36.490 --> 00:39:37.620
Goodbye,

00:39:38.830 --> 00:39:39.870
Mom.

00:39:41.920 --> 00:39:46.880
Excess interference and assistance
during the game can't be overlooked.

00:39:47.630 --> 00:39:50.380
You bastard! I'll kill you!

00:39:53.010 --> 00:39:55.510
You dug your own grave.

00:39:55.970 --> 00:39:58.140
Go join your family.

00:40:02.600 --> 00:40:03.980
Review complete.

00:40:04.400 --> 00:40:09.530
After collating this data with data
supplied by the First Inspector,

00:40:10.570 --> 00:40:12.820
eight counts have been found factual.

00:40:13.410 --> 00:40:17.330
You will be stripped of congressman status
and face enforcement.

00:40:31.970 --> 00:40:35.600
So, it's just you and me left.

00:40:35.720 --> 00:40:36.720
It's a pleasure.

00:40:37.510 --> 00:40:38.680
The pleasure is mine.

00:40:38.930 --> 00:40:40.480
By the way,

00:40:41.180 --> 00:40:45.360
you manipulated me to dispose of Saionji,
didn't you?

00:40:46.940 --> 00:40:48.690
That was a good play.

00:40:49.150 --> 00:40:51.820
Whatever do you mean?

00:40:55.410 --> 00:40:59.290
We'll take custody of Nisei
and of Kurisu O'Brien's son.

00:40:59.740 --> 00:41:03.370
Public Safety would probably
just institutionalize them.

00:41:04.370 --> 00:41:07.380
Nisei was collaborating with the MOFA?

00:41:07.630 --> 00:41:10.380
I always knew
you were quick on the uptake.

00:41:10.920 --> 00:41:13.300
Give Frederica Hanashiro a message:

00:41:13.880 --> 00:41:16.220
"I will humiliate you.

00:41:16.390 --> 00:41:19.100
I'm going to make you crawl at my feet."

00:41:19.760 --> 00:41:21.060
No way.

00:41:21.560 --> 00:41:23.060
Tell her yourself.

00:41:27.270 --> 00:41:28.560
Well, that's rude!

00:41:28.690 --> 00:41:30.610
National Center for Medical Research

00:41:31.280 --> 00:41:32.400
I'm sorry.

00:41:34.400 --> 00:41:36.110
What are you apologizing for?

00:41:36.990 --> 00:41:38.870
My Hue clouded.

00:41:40.450 --> 00:41:42.950
Hues have recovered with treatment before.

00:41:43.200 --> 00:41:47.000
Even murder won't necessarily
raise your Crime Coefficient.

00:41:48.000 --> 00:41:50.500
Like for inspectors
and Defense Force soldiers.

00:41:53.380 --> 00:41:55.550
I'm sorry, Kei.

00:41:56.470 --> 00:41:57.640
Don't worry.

00:41:58.050 --> 00:42:00.510
You'll be fine with psychological care.

00:42:01.140 --> 00:42:03.850
Sibyl took us in. We must believe in it.

00:42:12.360 --> 00:42:14.860
So, did I get shot for nothing?

00:42:15.490 --> 00:42:16.950
We defended the governor.

00:42:17.530 --> 00:42:20.030
We exposed Heaven's Leap's
illegal activities.

00:42:20.450 --> 00:42:21.870
It wasn't for nothing.

00:42:22.830 --> 00:42:24.000
Hey, Inspector,

00:42:24.620 --> 00:42:28.370
you did good.
You don't need to beat yourself up.

00:42:30.080 --> 00:42:32.630
Yeah. Thank you.

00:42:35.630 --> 00:42:37.510
Chief Shimotsuki Mika

00:42:37.630 --> 00:42:38.800
You have 1 new message

00:42:39.390 --> 00:42:42.560
Regarding Psycho-Pass decline
during pursuit of bomber

00:42:54.440 --> 00:42:56.820
Recorded value: 00.00

00:42:57.200 --> 00:42:58.990
Criminally asymptomatic?

00:43:01.240 --> 00:43:07.080
Now they know Arata Shindo is criminally
asymptomatic. Does that disappoint you?

00:43:09.460 --> 00:43:13.590
There's a reason Sibyl made him
an inspector in spite of that.

00:43:14.130 --> 00:43:17.800
So I'm sure he will remain an inspector.

00:43:18.720 --> 00:43:21.840
He's the ideal person for the job.

00:43:22.640 --> 00:43:27.730
Only someone capable of joining Sibyl
can remedy Sibyl's blind spots.

00:43:28.640 --> 00:43:31.480
"Once the hares are dead,
the hounds are expendable."

00:43:34.270 --> 00:43:36.320
I won't let you sacrifice anyone.

00:43:37.320 --> 00:43:41.450
They will reach the truth on their own.

00:43:56.460 --> 00:43:59.470
Stupid perfection in your own castle

00:44:01.630 --> 00:44:05.300
How smart. You cause me to yawn

00:44:06.760 --> 00:44:12.190
Look,
The key to the door is in your hand

00:44:12.310 --> 00:44:17.400
Don't you let anyone take control

00:44:17.610 --> 00:44:22.740
What do you want?

00:44:22.950 --> 00:44:28.080
Go get it. Play by your own rule

00:44:28.290 --> 00:44:34.000
The winner always controls the game

00:44:34.130 --> 00:44:38.920
You stand in your belief

00:44:42.340 --> 00:44:46.850
There's no promising future

00:44:47.310 --> 00:44:52.440
Always helpless
Crying for the moon

00:44:52.640 --> 00:44:57.690
Finger trembles in fear
With the weight of the trigger

00:44:57.860 --> 00:45:00.900
There's a way for us

00:45:01.030 --> 00:45:05.030
Show them how we fight

00:45:05.200 --> 00:45:08.200
Pull the trigger

00:45:18.880 --> 00:45:20.550
Sorry I called you over.

00:45:21.760 --> 00:45:23.050
I don't mind.

00:45:24.340 --> 00:45:26.260
I wanted to thank you as well.

00:45:26.680 --> 00:45:30.310
You really saved me in this case.
Thank you.

00:45:30.600 --> 00:45:34.690
No, I only did my duty.

00:45:39.570 --> 00:45:42.940
May I confess my sins to you?

00:45:46.530 --> 00:45:48.030
"Psycho-Pass" refers to the measurement
of a person's mind and personality.

00:45:48.200 --> 00:45:49.780
This is a work of fiction. Any resemblance
to real persons or groups is coincidental.
